  "comment": "The aux send knobs and the pan CV attenuators share the same places on the panel, and so do the aux 2 send knobs and the track routing buttons: the widget shows one set or the other according to the display button and the matching menu item, so only one of each pair can be clicked at a time. Both are given lines. The panel prints INSERT 1 - 8 and the code sets eight channels on the insert output, which agrees. Parameters 77 and 78 are named Group 1 and Group 2 by the maker but the code passes them to a group solo check, which is why their line calls them solo."
